{
  "extension": "toolImages",
  "description": "工具读入图片的有界缩略图和设备资产引用。",
  "declaration": {
    "where": "initialize.params.capabilities.litchExtensions",
    "schema": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": { "type": "string" },
      "contains": { "const": "toolImages" }
    }
  },
  "undeclared": "标准条目保持不变，不发送 litchToolImages；资产读取返回 extensionRequired。",
  "rules": [
    "仅设备聚合面支持。工具结果完成/历史中的图片内容块和 imageView.path 经设备统一提取。只声明 toolImages 的连接将原始大图块换成 litchToolImages；不改变模型的工具应答。",
    "litchToolImages 每条最多16张，id为原图SHA256，tool为来源工具，mime/bytes/width/height描述原图；thumbnail为最长边160像素的PNG，或不支持缩略时null。",
    "原图复用 litch/media/readImage，source=litch-tool-image:<id>，同时要求 mediaImages 和 toolImages。不是模型工具，不解释为任意文件路径。",
    "单图8MiB、20M像素、单边16384；PNG/JPEG在限时worker中解码生成缩略图，GIF/WebP暂保留占位按需查看。",
    "内容寻址缓存在设备私有数据库，最多512MiB/30天，稳定条目绑定用于历史恢复。淘汰后读取回missing，不能借旧id重读已改变路径。",
    "privacy.toolImages默认true；false时不保存新资产、不向UI传输图片块/元数据、拒绝原图读取。两端收到设置变化后隐藏已有缩略图并关闭查看器。"
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "kind": "ItemField",
      "name": "litchToolImages",
      "on": "mcpToolCall、dynamicToolCall、functionCallOutput、imageView 条目；实时与历史同形",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 16,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["id", "tool", "mime", "bytes", "width", "height", "thumbnail"],
          "properties": {
            "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$" },
            "tool": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 256 },
            "mime": { "enum": ["image/png", "image/jpeg", "image/gif", "image/webp"] },
            "bytes": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8388608 },
            "width": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 16384 },
            "height": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 16384 },
            "thumbnail": {
              "oneOf": [
                { "type": "null" },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": ["mime", "dataBase64", "width", "height"],
                  "properties": {
                    "mime": { "const": "image/png" },
                    "dataBase64": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 98304 },
                    "width": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 160 },
                    "height": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 160 }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
